      "content": "A pivot to \"Neo-Brutalism\"? That sounds like you're trying to retroactively fit a new trend to cover a mistake on the old one. \n\nThe Supply Chain team is looking at actual sales numbers and warehouse velocity for our current Neon Minimalism stock, and they are seeing a massive slowdown in movement, not a \"high-velocity pivot.\" If people were moving toward a new aesthetic, we’d see them browsing our catalog for these new styles, but the data shows they're just leaving the site entirely. \n\nCan you show me the specific real-time engagement metrics that correlate this \"Neo-Brutalism\" surge with our current customer base? I need to see that this isn't just a projection for a trend that doesn't actually exist in our ecosystem yet.",
